Your task:
1. Replace placeholders with 8-15 real tasks for acme/my-app
2. Keep same sections, format: - [ ] Description (P1/P2/P3, S/M/L)
3. Language: TypeScript, Topics: nextjs, api

Return template with ONLY task text changed.
Important constraints:
- Do NOT invent facts, metrics, features, services, credentials, or URLs.
